**Mass Suggestion uses one shared 24-hour maximum duration, with no consumed-reagent requirement added.**

It remains nonconcentration, with its existing RP cost, components, actual class access, task restrictions and early-ending conditions unchanged. This confirms the already-reviewed Control15 procedure rather than creating another school-specific version. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="0"}

All four design choices are now settled. The **preparation-round-only copied-feat Ready choice** still needs to replace the older both-round wording in a separately reviewed successor before implementation. No project files have been changed.
